    ('evil-hunter-1.411.hunter-info-v1', 'class_change:130', 'h4', 'Mana Charge', NULL, NULL, 'confirmed', 'resolved', 'class_change', 130, 'Gathers mana orbs to enhance skills.', 'When a hunter directly casts Thunderbolt, they obtain <color=#46CCFF>valueCount</color> mana orb(s). A mana orb lasts for <color=#46CCFF>keepTime sec</color>. Up to 5 mana orbs can be held. When casting an orb skill, <color=#46CCFF>secondValue</color> mana orb(s) are used to amplify the skill ATK by <color=#46CCFF>keepValue%</color>.
