The Mana Charge effect also applies to orb skills cast by a Familiar.
$(Amplification is deamplified by 50% in PvP)$', 10, 0, 0, 1, '{"index":130,"job":3,"subJob":0,"thirdJob":0,"fourthJob":1,"maxLevel":10,"coolTime":0,"upCoolTime":0,"keepTime":30,"upKeepTime":0,"keepValue":14,"upKeepValue":4,"secondValue":1,"upSecondValue":0,"valueTime":0,"upValueTime":0,"valueCount":1,"upValueCount":0,"firstStudySoul":500,"addStudySoul":10}'::jsonb),
